{"id":967,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>6月17日下午，在2026届毕业生即将背起行囊、奔赴四方之际，机械工程学院组织院领导与专业负责人，由学生干部引导，分组走进文瀛公寓区的多栋学生宿舍，开展走访慰问毕业生宿舍活动，为即将开启人生新篇章的学子们送上学院的殷切关怀与美好祝愿。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_LzlFaUzvYo77Yn9lUPU4CYLzNDLR9AbMm-bLm6fLRUDMll0gihFp2hmCIa0USyYnSysnkyPMmCPnlrfnm9inlUYL8WkozL8Mm7DLz7PoznFLz-YLzGiM8MFM8lPnllJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LZozvsgtA8pU1cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=38977&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A2E7D1661EEAF85ED23BB93461611194/1221057C/7E1EE\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_Ul-F4M4CanN7DM9mvaMRGbolnkMzNAaU4NiMzvPM4-4UzC0gihFp2hmCIa0LShkMSyDU1yYnNV7LmfRnllDMlLDnm9DLlQRU4NZU8V7UNrFnlCbLmCYL7VFLmUiMm9DgtXaQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0LzU4oky4oRNsMYbw6218c&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=38977&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p><p>下午5点，参与走访的老师们各自出发，随后由学生干部引导，分别前往文瀛公寓的多处毕业生宿舍区域。每间宿舍，院领导都与同学们亲切问候、促膝交谈，详细询问大家的毕业状况，认真倾听同学们对学院各方各面的真切感受。专业负责人们结合各自学科特点，对同学们即将踏入的行业领域给出务实建议，鼓励大家将四年所学化为立足社会的底气，在岗位上踏实耕耘、勇于突破。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_nm7FDM7r2nNLaM9mG4ozl4UNMVLRAAfM7LDnzM7UzV7L8C0gihFp2hmCIa0LSy4okhRn1h2olQRoRV7M8n7Mz7sM4rRUm94MlrVLzGDU4AFL4-4M7rfUzfFMRC4nm-Jqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LZozvsgtA8pU1cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=38977&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/138CFF9FC81D7DD51775CB835EE106C8/3234EAA0/463F2\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_Lz9FPM4NanRTVM9R9Znm6fLz-DMR7AZMRUPn7nfMz7YLzL0gihFp2hmCIa0LYh7UYy4U1yPolUiUlVfM7lZL49bnzT2o778MzCYM7MfLmrFLzUYMll4M4WFLznRMmN4gtXaQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0LzU4oky4oRNsMYbw6218c&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=38977&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p><p>走访过程中，学院领导对同学们在学业、科研和各类活动中取得的成绩给予肯定，并叮嘱大家在外注意身体健康，保持积极心态，从容应对未来工作和生活中的挑战。毕业生们对老师们的到访表示欢迎，师生之间交流坦诚、气氛融洽。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_LR-FaMmNYMRNiM9zC8MmAkM8lYMNCADUmAfnN-bLlVfn7C0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyiMSyPoShVL7LbozNZMlV2M4n2LmC8LmlsozrRUmGbnzTFMRWRn7LYMRrFMRU4LR-Jqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LZozvsgtA8pU1cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=38977&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C5519E0C99985AF74F26425795CB09E9/42CDC245/44302\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_U4LFbU8U8nzLsM97M2MR7snN-bU8VAkUm7ZoRlPL8QkLmU0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyDMkyPnkhfU474LRlbnRM2U8WRLNUbMmQVoRr7nRn7MRWFMRlPo7-PLRnFLzn7nmAVgtXaQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0LzU4oky4oRNsMYbw6218c&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=38977&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p><p> &nbsp; &nbsp;此次宿舍走访慰问活动，不仅让毕业生们感受到了学院的温暖与关怀，也进一步增进了师生之间的感情。毕业生们纷纷表示，感谢学院领导和老师们一直以来的关心与培养，无论未来身在何处，都不会忘记母校的培育之恩，将牢记学院的嘱托，以饱满的热情和坚定的信心迎接新的挑战，用实际行动为母校争光。<br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>文/耿宇杰</p><p><br></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_LzlFaUzvYo77Yn9lUPU4CYLzNDLR9AbMm-bLm6fLRUDMll0gihFp2hmCIa0USyYnSysnkyPMmCPnlrfnm9inlUYL8WkozL8Mm7DLz7PoznFLz-YLzGiM8MFM8lPnllJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LZozvsgtA8pU1cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=38977&e=.jpg"}